From 4663edb43fab09dcccfb7db7ad1723307d0bf02f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:43:39 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] chore: remove sprint and task identifiers from source
 comments

Roadmap vocabulary (Sprint N, S3-T2, Phase N, issue numbers in parentheses) is
removed from code and test comments so the source describes what the code does,
not when it was scheduled. Dataset provenance strings are untouched because they
are content-hashed.

